{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maou's Crucible</strong> is a community-driven horde survivor roguelite featuring original characters  from various creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by <strong>Germain</strong>, a timeless scholar and alchemist, participants from countless worlds gather within a singularity, a nexus that connects all universes, where they would compete for the title of &quot;Demon Lord&quot;. However, this title is merely a bait to confront a far greater threat lurking beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the Crucible, survive against hordes of enemies, and claim the title of <strong>Demon Lord</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of playable characters</strong> from multiple creators, each with unique abilities and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ upgrades</strong> to create powerful and unpredictable builds each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Garden</strong>, a secondary mode where you can relax, decorate your own garden, and interact with your characters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087610?t=1760136180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087610?t=1760136180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087610/b8f44124a4923f39931b9db8ba8d1d5a3d2038c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760136180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087610/b8f44124a4923f39931b9db8ba8d1d5a3d2038c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760136180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maou's Crucible</strong> is a community-driven horde survivor roguelite featuring original characters  from various creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by <strong>Germain</strong>, a timeless scholar and alchemist, participants from countless worlds gather within a singularity, a nexus that connects all universes, where they would compete for the title of &quot;Demon Lord&quot;. However, this title is merely a bait to confront a far greater threat lurking beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the Crucible, survive against hordes of enemies, and claim the title of <strong>Demon Lord</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of playable characters</strong> from multiple creators, each with unique abilities and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ upgrades</strong> to create powerful and unpredictable builds each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Garden</strong>, a secondary mode where you can relax, decorate your own garden, and interact with your characters</p></li></ul>","developers":["Maou's Crucible Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087610/61f42b49708de59c4eacd5470c3ae2c021c04246/header.jpg?t=1760136180","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087610/187247683/7a289d0410eea35120d7299b32dc487b4c5c4960/1759641765/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759960132","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087610/187247683/7a289d0410eea35120d7299b32dc487b4c5c4960/1759641765/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759960132","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087610/187247683/7a289d0410eea35120d7299b32dc487b4c5c4960/1759641765/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759960132","id":25721243